			title: "Flux Dust"
			description: ["Flux Dust has no crafting recipe. You make it in the world.", "", "Place OBSIDIAN directly on top of BEDROCK, drop Redstone Dust items onto", "the obsidian, then click the obsidian. The redstone converts and the", "obsidian is consumed.", "", "REI has a 'Creating Flux' page for it if the layout will not take."]
