			title: "Flux Cores"
			description: ["Flux Dust, obsidian and an Eye of Ender make four Flux Cores.", "", "Cores are the base of every flux device. Nine dust compressed with a core", "gives a Flux Block, which is both a crafting component and the storage", "block's ingredient."]
