			id: "EDE81E2E1975C932"
			title: "Plug And Point"
			description: ["The whole mod is two blocks and they are easy to get backwards.", "", "A Flux PLUG goes on a generator and pushes power INTO the network.", "A Flux POINT goes on a machine and pulls power OUT of the network.", "", "Both attach to the face of the block they serve. No cable between them --", "the network is wireless, and it crosses dimensions."]
