			id: "7439710F4D8CCDE3"
			title: "The Controller"
			description: ["Flux cores, a Flux Block and flux dust.", "", "ONE Controller per network, and only one. It wirelessly charges items in", "the inventories of players inside its range, and it unlocks the network's", "full statistics and per-device transfer limits.", "", "Networks are created in any flux device's GUI. You get a small number", "of your own -- most people need exactly one."]
