			description: ["Planks, a chest, a comparator, a diamond and an ender pearl.", "", "Tom's Simple Storage has exactly one core block: the Inventory Connector.", "Every inventory TOUCHING it becomes part of one shared pool.", "", "It is a surface-area problem. Six faces is six chests -- everything else", "in this half of the chapter exists to get around that."]
