			description: ["Inventory Cable is planks, sticks, a trapdoor and a chest -- six a craft.", "", "Cable alone carries nothing. It needs an Inventory Cable Connector at each", "end: one on the storage connector, one on the remote chest or terminal.", "", "The Filtered connector adds an item filter to that link, so you can send", "only cobblestone down one run."]
